Open Vanilla 0039: the realm dresses a duel body itself. On every arrival in the Duels hangout, and each minute
while there: the class's spells and weapon skills, every gear set of the class in the bags (the other faction's
sets, with the nearest wearable pieces, for pairs that have none of their own), and the first set worn when the
body is (nearly) bare. No addon needed for any of it; the Armory still changes it all. Someone already
dressed is left as they are.

